message: "Please cite ahead-rev-sim when using its workload, execution-proof, RTL-attachment, physical-substrate, or EVP artifacts."
title: "ahead-rev-sim: workload-to-physics evidence tooling for reversible and heterogeneous RISC-V compute"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sandhu
    given-names: Jonathan
version: 0.10.0
date-released: 2026-08-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BigBirdReturns/ahead-rev-sim"
url: "https://github.com/BigBirdReturns/ahead-rev-sim"
abstract: >-
  ahead-rev-sim provides instantiated information-effect analysis, exact
  reversible execution proofs, workload custody, provider-neutral physical
  compute interfaces, executed RTL attachment evidence, scale and venue
  receipts, causal synchronization, and complete-system Energy, Volume, and
  Performance qualification for RISC-V and heterogeneous physical-compute
  research.
keywords:
  - RISC-V
